<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9516] Vaccum cannot complete after rebalance</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9516</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In mvcc tests we wait for full Vacuum cleanup in &lt;tt&gt;afterTest&lt;/tt&gt; method in a sake of tests isolation. &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.mvcc.CacheMvccTransactionsTest#testRebalanceSimple&lt;/tt&gt; hangs waiting Vacuum to complete. Most likely it was broken after implementing &lt;tt&gt;Cache.size&lt;/tt&gt; for SQL operations over mvcc caches. Size for Cache API was not implemented properly (see related ticket).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
